[Set][ up] your[ terminal] device[ for] 9600[ b][aud][,][ 8][ bit],[ no] parity[,] 1[ stop][ bit] and no handshaking. Use a[ null]-[mod]em configuration ([trans]mit and receive signals[ crossed] over to[ enable] DTE-to[-]D[TE] communication). The crossover adapters[ supplied] with the server[ provide] a[ null][-]mod[em] configuration.[
][NET][ M][GT][ –] Connect[ this][ port][ to] an Ethernet[ network].[ This][ port][ requires][ an] IP[ address]. By default, the port is configured[ for][ DHCP], or[ you] can[ assign] an IP[ address][.][
