Michael[ Engel]hard is the editor of four anthologies of[ outdoors][ writing] and the author of[ several] essay collections, as well[ as] of a[ book] about polar bears[.][ His] articles have appeared in[ Sierra][,][ Outside][,][ National] Wildlife, the San Francisco Chronicle, High Country News[,] and other publications[.][ Tr][ained] as a cultural[ anthrop]ologist[ at] the University of[ Alaska][ Fair]banks, he has[ participated][ in] fieldwork[ north] of[ the] Arctic Circle. He guides wilderness[ trips][ in][ the][ Grand] Canyon, Gates of the Arctic National Park,[ and] the[ Arctic] National[ Wildlife][ Refuge][,] his favorite places in[ the] world[.]

